    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="232" width="832" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" wrap="false"><p>流程闭环：前置校验 — 过程留痕 — 结果回写</p></content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="64" startY="270" endX="326" endY="270"><border color="rgba(201,166,107,1)" width="2"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="280" width="262" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" wrap="false"><p>① 前置资格校验</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="308" width="262" height="150">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p>启动任免或职级晋升前，自动核验该干部近三年年度考核结果，未达标直接拦截，把干部选拔的制度规则固化进系统。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="349" startY="270" endX="611" endY="270"><border color="rgba(201,166,107,1)" width="2"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="349" topLeftY="280" width="262" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" wrap="false"><p>② 全过程留痕</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="349" topLeftY="308" width="262" height="150">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p>六个阶段各自建表，分别保存会议票决、推荐票数、考察材料、公示内容等信息，每一步操作都可回溯、可审计。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="634" startY="270" endX="896" endY="270"><border color="rgba(201,166,107,1)" width="2"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="634" topLeftY="280" width="262" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" bold="true" color="rgba(20,42,73,1)" wrap="false"><p>③ 结果自动回写</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="634" topLeftY="308" width="262" height="150">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(62,76,92,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p>任职备案通过后自动更新干部档案现任职务、职务层次与在岗状态；调配、晋升同此机制，删除记录则按剩余记录重算状态。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="474" width="832" height="24">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(31,58,95,1)" wrap="false"><p>设计要点：以干部档案为单一事实源，由业务记录驱动档案状态，杜绝多处维护造成的数据不一致。</p></content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="510" width="500" height="18">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" color="rgba(140,152,166,1)" wrap="false"><p>高校干部人事组织管理系统 · 答辩汇报</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="820" topLeftY="510" width="76" height="18">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" color="rgba(140,152,166,1)" textAlign="right" wrap="false"><p>16 / 22</p></content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note><content textType="body"><p>以最复杂的干部任免为例，业务分为动议、民主推荐、组织考察、讨论决定、任前公示、任职备案六个阶段。设计上形成闭环：启动前先做近三年考核的资格校验；过程中六个阶段分别建表、全程留痕；任职备案后自动回写干部档案。调配和晋升也采用同样的"业务记录驱动档案状态"机制，保证全局数据一致。</p></content></note>
